              "quote": "Unassuming could get an entry in the Kensington Palace at Royal Ascot. I'm not sure if she will get in, but with a penalty she might. She's a filly who has done well off a break and it was her first try on turf for us. I'm delighted to get her back in the winner's circle. She's a pretty easy horse to train, she makes my life easier and is going the right way. She travels very strongly and will be suited to turf racing way better than the all-weather - George Boughey, trainer."
