              "distance_f": "9.5",
              "distance_y": "2084",
              "quote": "Marhaba Ghaiyyath was still quite raw. We went round on the wrong lead for a lot of the race and had to do it the hard way in front. I think you'd have seen a better horse if he'd had something to aim at, but he got the job done. He's actually quite weak and I think he could come back to a mile and he could step back up in trip as he gets a bit stronger - Billy Loughnane, jockey, speaking on Sky Sports Racing."
