          "owner": "Sheikh Ahmed Al Maktoum",
          "owner_id": "own_59124",
          "prev_trainers": [],
          "prev_owners": [],
          "comment": "",
          "spotlight": "",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-05-05",
              "horse": "Elmalka",
              "horse_id": "hrs_37821714",
              "race": "Qipco 1000 Guineas Stakes (Group 1) (Fillies) (British Champions Series)",
              "race_id": "rac_11196341",
              "course": "Newmarket",
              "course_id": "crs_988",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Elmalka got very unbalanced. She just took a couple of strides to organise herself. I was happy with the way she travelled but she's just inexperienced. She's very tough and I think the further she's going to go the better she's going to be. She's tough and she's learning and improving. She's very easy to ride. She switches off. I was always behind the bridle so when she goes up in trip it shouldn't be a problem - Silvestre de Sousa, jockey, speaking to ITV."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "She was just a bit outclassed by colts in the Prix d'Ispahan but she travelled like a tank and I think that race told us she's a miler. She's a Guineas winner and I think the stiff mile at Ascot will really suit her. There are some good older fillies around this year and it will be a tough race, but she hasn't put in a bad run yet and I think the set-up will suit her perfectly.  09-06-25"
            }
          ],
