              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "She got into that Bellewstown race because of the auction prices and missed the kick, something you shouldn't be able to do there, come from so far back. We threw Atsila in the deep end here but she's obviously a smart filly. I was half thinking of running her in a handicap but Barry (Fowler - owner) said no lets throw her into the Athasi and see where she stands. It looked a good field, fast ground and they went a good gallop so there's no fluke about it. She's quite lazy at home so hard to judge. I think she's deserved a crack at a big one - Donnacha O'Brien, trainer."
