          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-04-23",
              "horse": "Fifty Nifty",
              "horse_id": "hrs_40941327",
              "race": "QuinnBet Second To The Favourite Restricted Maiden Stakes (For Horses In Bands B, C & D) (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11236823",
              "course": "Yarmouth",
              "course_id": "crs_2704",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1763",
              "quote": "That was a slight surprise. Fifty Nifty has worked nicely at home but I wasn't expecting him to go away and win like that. He's a really exciting prospect and fingers crossed we can have a lovely time with him this season - Tom Clover, trainer, speaking on Sky Sports Racing."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He clearly wasn't right at Newmarket last time as he was running with his head in the air. I don't know whether he got his tongue over the bit or something. Sometimes at Newmarket horses just have a bad experience and don't run up to scratch. He wouldn't have blown a candle out afterwards and he's clearly better than that. It's unfortunate it happened but hopefully we can get him back on track and go from there. We'd like to give him a couple of weeks in the paddock and, while we were hoping he'd go to Ascot, that looks unlikely at this stage. It would be nice to get him back to the July course, where he's won. We like him a lot. 14-05-25"
            }
          ],
