              "quote": "The faster the ground, the better Documenting is. The one worry was no pace and it'd be tactical, but Jack knows him well and Able Kane gave us something to aim at. He's a tough dude and we put him in the Ayr Gold Cup because I'd love to see him in an eyeballs-out six-furlong race. I've never seen him off the bridle early in the race and it's an option if the ground's quick - Kevin Frost, trainer."
