              "quote": "He's a lovely horse who I bought earlier this month and he's settled in really well. He's a lovely, big, relaxed, long-striding horse who's won at a mile and run well at 1m2f and looks to have plenty of ability. Ger Lyons is a very good trainer and I don't know if there's a lot of improvement in him, but he'll give his new owner a lot of fun. He looks as though he wants good ground and a galloping track. I put him in an early-closing race at York and the Cambridgeshire could be a good long-term target. 26-07-24"
