          "comment": "",
          "spotlight": "",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He did very well last year when winning four races, but having started out on 75 he shot up to 104. It seemed a good idea at the time to send him out to Meydan over the winter but things did not really work out for him there, which was a shame. He was on the go for quite a while so we are giving him a break now and he will be back on turf, when the ground gets quicker as he is far more effective with top of the ground conditions. We will be looking to the big 5f sprints with him and hope that we can continue to find improvement up to at least Listed level. I would think we would be looking to May before he is back in action. 22-03-22"
            }
          ],
